      "id": "23b5e921b2a922d9",
      "text": "# The Agentprivacy Origin 🛡️\n\nThe skeleton was forged in one specific fight — taking back the **seventh capital**: privacy as value. In the Privacy-is-Value model (PVM), privacy is foundational capital, not an additive nice-to-have; your behavioural residue is the artifact, disclosure is the metric, consent is the hard constraint, and the door is sovereignty."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "af3916561180a7d3",
      "text": "The harness is that architecture made operational: the Swordsman guards the seventh capital, the Mage spends only what is authorized, and nothing outward moves without the First Person. Taking back the seventh capital *is* a harness instance — the first one."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "f2671419bf6fffd3",
      "text": "But nothing in the mechanism mentions privacy, and nothing in it mentions your domain either. The separation is information-theoretic — a statement about routing, not content — which is why the same bound holds for qubits, constraint systems, prose, and consent terms without modification. **The duality is the constant; the config is the variable.**"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "a8d70a6a2620f71a",
      "text": "## Where to go deeper\n\nThe living corpus is at **agentprivacy.ai**, and the public guide federation at **guide.agentprivacy.ai** — fourteen sibling sites projected from canon by exactly the pattern this farm demonstrates. The corpus itself never travels with the harness (trust T3: strangers meet only in the axioms); what you are holding is the method."
    }
  ],
